/* Generated by tools/pf2_symnames.py -- do not edit by hand.
 *
 * PairIP hides 200 of libunity.so's 336 PLT imports: it shrinks .dynsym,
 * rewrites the head of .rela.plt and leaves those GOT slots pointing at
 * PLT0, whose resolver slot is never filled, so the first call to any of
 * them branches to 0.  Its DT_INIT asks the PairIP VM to patch them.
 *
 * The original SysV .hash and .dynsym plus the tails of .dynstr and
 * .rela.plt survive in the file, which is enough to name most slots
 * offline and fill them ourselves.  Slots we could not name are listed
 * separately and get a self-identifying probe until a run names them.
 */

